  "body": "Property Files: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/D95R\r\n\r\nEnjoy the best of modern living and coastal convenience in this beautifully designed brand-new home, perfectly positioned just a short stroll from Browns Bay Beach and Village. Offering 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms and 2 spacious living areas, this stylish residence on a freehold section combines contemporary comfort, practical design and an enviable location, making it an excellent choice for families of all ages.\r\n\r\nStep inside and be welcomed by a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, thoughtfully designed to bring everyone together. The contemporary kitchen offers a stylish and functional space for everyday cooking and entertaining, while the living and dining areas flow seamlessly onto a sunny deck. Whether you're enjoying a morning coffee, hosting weekend BBQs or simply relaxing outdoors, this inviting space is perfect for making the most of everyday living. A convenient guest toilet adds practicality to the ground floor.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, a welcoming family lounge provides a second living space, ideal for movie nights, quiet relaxation or giving family members their own space to unwind. The master bedroom offers a lovely private retreat, complete with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and its own balcony where you can relax and enjoy beautiful sea views. A second bedroom also enjoys the convenience of its own ensuite, while the remaining two well-proportioned bedrooms are serviced by a modern family bathroom complete with a bathtub, perfect for families with young children.\r\n\r\nAn internal-access double garage provides secure parking and additional storage, completing this well-designed home with the practicality that busy families appreciate.\r\n\r\nLocation is another standout feature. Within walking distance of Browns Bay School and zoned for Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Rangitoto College, this is an address families will appreciate. Beautiful Rothesay Bay Beach, Browns Bay Beach and the vibrant village are just a short stroll away, offering supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, shops and a wide range of everyday amenities. With a bus stop just up the road, convenience is truly at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nBrand new, spacious and superbly located, this is a fantastic opportunity to secure a modern family home with sea views in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. Come and experience the lifestyle for yourself!\r\n\r\nExplore another home in this development by following the link below:\r\nhttps://www.cooperandco.co.nz/listing/l43002824-2e-hyde-road-rothesay-bay-nz-0630\r\n\r\n*Conjunctions from all Agents welcome*",
